  "description": "SKY130 NFET flavors: output curves (Id–Vds, stepped Vgs)",
  "schematic": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 100,
        "y": -118,
        "title": "SKY130 NFET output curves — what this testbench does",
        "lines": [
          "Four NFET flavors (MN1 nfet, MN2 lvt, MN3 5v, MN4 nvt)",
          "share one drain supply VD1 and one gate supply VG1.",
          "VD1 sweeps Vds 0 -> 1.8 V while VG1 steps Vgs through",
          "0.9 / 1.35 / 1.8 V, tracing a family of Id-Vds curves.",
          "Each 1-ohm sense resistor RS turns source current into",
          "the probes id_01v8, id_lvt, id_5v, id_nvt (= drain Id).",
          "",
          "Set MN1.w_um = 2.0 and re-run to see id_01v8 roughly",
          "double -- drain current scales with device width."
        ]
      }
    ],
